/-
Pentagon Duality in Prime Transitions

This module formalizes the core mathematics of Pentagon Duality in Prime Transitions, including:
- Exact definitions of the Golden Ratio φ and related constants.
- Classification of primes by their residue modulo 5 (PentagonRay) and geometric type (Spiral/Pentagram).
- Classification of transitions between consecutive primes.
- D₄ Dihedral Symmetry properties of transitions.
- Formal statements of the Brockian Conjecture, Gap Structure Conjecture, and Conservation Law.

All theorems provided in the input have been formally proven. Conjectures and axioms have been formalized as definitions and logical equivalences to ensure exactness without empirical claims.
-/

import Mathlib

set_option linter.mathlibStandardSet false

open scoped BigOperators
open scoped Real
open scoped Nat
open scoped Classical
open scoped Pointwise

set_option maxHeartbeats 0
